{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"enojar":{"host":"3e32aa00","siblings":["c21f8752"]}},"rows":{"c21f8752":{"word":"enojes","rank":9255,"meanings":[{"headword":"enojar","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:enojar:e18","translation":"to anger","context":"to upset"},{"headword":"enojarse","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:enojarse:036","translation":"to get angry","context":"to get upset"},{"headword":"enojarse","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:enojarse:d70","translation":"to get mad","context":"to get upset"}]}},"examples":{"c21f8752":{"m":[[{"t":"Sí, hasta el punto en que me enojes.","e":"Yeah, up to which point you piss me off.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"c9a6b1510f799ece4be441f0c22996f7","i":"f4ab6e187cab65933f4b933adb2c956d","r":"5017740:7016138:144:3103451","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5017740","7016138","144"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No enojes a Tom.","e":"Don't make Tom angry.","s":"tatoeba","x":"43e40c462ebc442b568643ec38f371bd","i":"c3ef1996f52e8d73fc8cbe78a81c7a40","r":"9483515:2261219","c":"dpcossio","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9483515","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9483515","b":"Tatoeba sentence #9483515 by dpcossio; English translation #2261219 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9483515","tu":1,"w":["tuple",0]}],[{"t":"No te enojes conmigo, ya que lo hice por tu bien.","e":"Don't be angry with me, for I did it for your sake.","s":"tatoeba","x":"11b497a56df0216c8bb140308575eccb","i":"532a2b71bb69a5a23d8fa5e64d5a9f1a","r":"760105:17374","c":"darinmex","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/760105","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/760105","b":"Tatoeba sentence #760105 by darinmex; English translation #17374 by darinmex","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/760105","tu":1,"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Por favor, no te enojes conmigo por pedirte que fueras.","e":"Please don't be mad at me that I told you to come down there.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"375d6285bde7c1ba1b19c7122b90741a","i":"983a88d3a819b3c88eaa89cf39b10ab9","r":"4572514:6924646:1039:816628","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4572514","6924646","1039"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Antes de que te enojes: estás a punto de ganar mucho dinero.","e":"Before you get too upset, you're about to make a whole hell of a lot of money.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"591593b9f14cf53e331a28dde0262dea","i":"d85ed7aa073df96e0d2a3b1584b44420","r":"4633430:6901621:568:878537","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4633430","6901621","568"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Te traje aquí porque necesito que te enojes de nuevo.","e":"I brought you here because I need you to get angry again.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"6cd6cd329f5f0d36f17f200ebf832d1a","i":"dc4df6f83e9a11ffb2ee18931188002f","r":"6028544:6755977:12:2661099","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6028544","6755977","12"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Estas cansado, herido, y dañado, no te enojes.","e":"You are tired, busted, and hurt, is what you are.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"813c442977ade0ceb5afaf122598c5ad","i":"e4e1186d57a1621c543eda33766bf0f6","r":"2918606:6850051:370:199240","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2918606","6850051","370"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Pero la única vez que necesito que te enojes por mí, ¿me dejas tirado?","e":"But the one time I need you to get angry for me, you leave me hanging?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"9fb385d51b79690e85ef8acc707e7445","i":"2ae6f5968772da5ba632510f680890fd","r":"6287636:7001856:322:3904749","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6287636","7001856","322"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Qué demonios hice para que te enojes?","e":"- What the hell did I do to piss you off?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"d7a9e6ee50df60a6ba9982bce6c945d8","i":"45437a3ba44feca88afbf0ec864b3a78","r":"3827684:6838153:852:411699","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3827684","6838153","852"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No te enojes antes de escucharme.","e":"Don't get angry and just listen to me.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"6c5b24d0a4d47ab40f8ea19ba23e3dfa","i":"4fb8f1535f6f567d9d2f3125da0a5a16","r":"6302160:6989069:300:2837534","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6302160","6989069","300"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No te enojes, simplemente ven.","e":"I'm not mad. What don't you come in?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"db48df1b68f935255a39583294951ca8","i":"0663caf7dccfbf5e83f6954b970aaaef","r":"2425866:6715152:764:146460","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2425866","6715152","764"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No te enojes conmigo, ¿sí?","e":"Don't be too sore with me, okay?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"7053daf746a72913f3b76cd76bfa5293","i":"2597be5e8a977f6139b9afc112d0824b","r":"3885524:6722610:1029:429108","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3885524","6722610","1029"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No te enojes por ello.","e":"Don't get all pissed off about it.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"8b5363f1cc83aa27fc4a8af48243078e","i":"423d3fbd8edc583ba604989009d2a7cd","r":"4482572:6880967:294:742618","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4482572","6880967","294"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No te enojes con él.","e":"Don't be angry with him.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"ee88230ebf017549e0e8db4f24243b50","i":"4657334efdedc48313f49da2dc2be319","r":"1227183:7010944:1166:9709","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["1227183","7010944","1166"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No te enojes, ¿de acuerdo?","e":"Don't be mad, ok?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"137bfa4712bd6319e9a36307cc0e8388","i":"97aaf10f9b9d6e0c4bf8a7ea3656c70e","r":"3040964:6603778:620:225959","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3040964","6603778","620"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Está bien que te enojes, Con.","e":"It's okay that you're angry, Con.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"630422a5a89c0897d29f6c76e5029262","i":"cb66c56b1abfaac88d2acd